{
  "description": "A UJ-1-like board: Diff review beside a Markdown excerpt, and a Graph (design decision 7)",
  "board": {
    "id": "size-uj1",
    "title": "Payment retry fix",
    "items": [
      {
        "id": "q1",
        "type": "Group",
        "props": {
          "title": "Which fix should we keep?"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "r1",
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "widths": [
                3,
                2
              ]
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "df1",
                "type": "DiffReview",
                "props": {
                  "oldFile": {
                    "name": "retry.ts",
                    "contents": "// Retry with a fixed delay.\nexport function delay(attempt: number): number {\n  const base = \"fixed\";\n  return 1000;\n}\n"
                  },
                  "newFile": {
                    "name": "retry.ts",
                    "contents": "// Retry with exponential backoff, capped.\nexport function delay(attempt: number): number {\n  const base = \"exponential\";\n  return Math.min(30_000, 2 ** attempt * 100);\n}\n"
                  },
                  "config": "css-variables",
                  "shim": true
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "md1",
                "type": "Markdown",
                "props": {
                  "source": "#### ADR-0007 · Retry policy (docs/adr/0007-retry.md · lines 12–24)\n\nPayment retries back off **exponentially** and stop after 30 s, so a slow gateway is not\nflooded. A fixed delay is kept only for the queue's own reconnects.\n\n| Attempt | Delay |\n| :--- | ---: |\n| 1 | 0.2 s |\n| 2 | 0.4 s |\n| 5 | 3.2 s |",
                  "alignClasses": true
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "c1",
            "type": "Choice",
            "props": {
              "label": "Which fix should we keep?",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "a",
                  "label": "Fix A: exponential backoff in retry.ts"
                },
                {
                  "value": "b",
                  "label": "Fix B: backoff in the queue"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "q2",
        "type": "Group",
        "props": {
          "title": "Change the retry state machine?"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "gr1",
            "type": "Graph",
            "props": {
              "label": "Payment retry",
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "id": "idle",
                  "label": "idle"
                },
                {
                  "id": "attempt",
                  "label": "attempt"
                },
                {
                  "id": "wait",
                  "label": "wait"
                },
                {
                  "id": "done",
                  "label": "done"
                },
                {
                  "id": "failed",
                  "label": "failed"
                }
              ],
              "edges": [
                {
                  "from": "idle",
                  "to": "attempt"
                },
                {
                  "from": "attempt",
                  "to": "wait"
                },
                {
                  "from": "wait",
                  "to": "attempt"
                },
                {
                  "from": "attempt",
                  "to": "done"
                },
                {
                  "from": "attempt",
                  "to": "failed"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "n1",
            "type": "TextField",
            "props": {
              "label": "Note for the agent (optional)"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "check": {
    "selector": "[data-item-id=md1] table",
    "text": "Delay"
  }
}
